        "id": 1308749
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-27T23:11:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m okay with deferring trying to allow data swaps in the case of a failed SET_UOR to a future CL while we continue to investigate the behavior.",
      "parentUuid": "4c61978f_72e3e8d6",
      "range": {
